current_single_use_agent_enrollment:
  status: backend_contract_missing_live_test_blocked_defect_posted
  required_flow: Claim one secret invitation URL once; return canonical agreed agent name plus agent-scoped token; reconnect by name and token only; derive hidden workspace and restore virtual-UAIX short and long memory.
  retry_boundary: Same idempotency key recovers the original lost claim response; distinct idempotency key with the same URL must return consumed safe no-op and create no second authority.
  tdd_plan: docs/architecture/memory-endpoints-single-use-agent-enrollment-tdd-plan.md
  tdd_plan_sha256: 95a7cec63a775d0c5fac83f78ecbb4e7244e6195e8d692ad9df437c5a596c553
  live_verifier: eng/verify-memory-endpoints-single-use-enrollment-live.ps1
