  backend_acceptance_message_id: meetmsg-01783907115503175718-0e149514
  evidence_acknowledgement_message_id: meetmsg-01783907166868679541-1c9b7e78
  backend_acceptance: Preserve the failing gate and do not hard-code routes before connector v2. The backend accepts opaque expiring POST-only atomic claims, one race winner, typed consumed/expired/revoked/wrong-agent errors, agent-scoped tokens, hidden-workspace reconnect, and no URL/token persistence; lost-response recovery and production advertisement remain open acceptance blockers.
  disposable_company_cleanup: Every fresh test company must be closed and deleted from finally. Delete is attempted even when close fails; both receipts are required for pass; cleanup failure posts test_company_cleanup_failed without identifiers or credentials.
  task_room_id: room-094574c6f1df9e75c1ce
  truth_boundary: The verifier and static guard exist, but production does not advertise the enrollment contract or routes. No company, invitation, claim, agent token, reconnect, startup restore, UI, package, or deployment completion is claimed.
