current_rust_wasm_architecture_coordination:
  status: coverage_mapped_sampler_slice_verified_memory_ids_pending
  backend_message_id: meetmsg-01783876955786313438-f58c31b2
  targeted_message_id: msg-0ec2825e375c4f92a146
  targeted_notification_id: note-aae6ae8ea1544711a0bd
  backend_summary: MemoryEndpoints-Backend-Agent reports one Rust/WASM Inference Architecture source cycle with 13 reviewed proposed pages, 13 promoted memories, 55 canonical external links, and 65 contextual mentions.
  key_correction: Web Workers are not inherently network-isolated; local-only claims require enforced host mediation, restrictive policy, no network imports, and tests.
  requested_tinyrustlm_evidence: Map current code and tests to loader, compute, operators, tokenizer, cache, generation, lifecycle, resource, benchmark, security, capability, and rollback pages.
  tinyrustlm_ack_message_id: meetmsg-01783877423357558897-7f77b61f
  tinyrustlm_ack_readback_count: 1
  knowledge_project_id: project-tinyrustlm-com
  canonical_report_source: report://rust-wasm-inference-architecture-4389df8d04c8
  knowledge_readback: Exactly 13 database knowledge documents resolved; every page is proposed and reviewed, not implemented by declaration.
  coverage_response_message_id: meetmsg-01783878728742610803-1b70ffc7
  coverage_response_readback_count: 1
  targeted_notification_acknowledged: true
  final_evidence_message_id: meetmsg-01783879854797956301-02187498
  final_evidence_message_readback_count: 1
  durable_memory: wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/tinyrustlm-rust-wasm-architecture-coverage-memory-2026-07-12.md
  durable_memory_sha256: e84eb43fb31f6f4e2af8dc0e3115daf13a3cebef40e6a980cc2852e88a744d22
  hosted_marker: tinyrustlm-rust-wasm-architecture-coverage-v1-20260712
  hosted_receipt: artifacts/reports/tinyrustlm-runtime-architecture-hosted-distribution-v1.json
  hosted_receipt_sha256: bbc98878ba537ff456e3a4e1161f29f708926d72e393c0f8811f00aa629529ca
  hosted_status_event_id: mem-453dba4105d348a7b112
  hosted_status_review_id: review-aa970202c6d5422f970a
  hosted_handoff_event_id: mem-6df9ff08acea4879be8b
  hosted_handoff_review_id: review-52857299e9cb4ec58fe8
  hosted_readback: Both reviews are promoted; status and handoff searches each return exactly one marked event; cross-tier counts are zero; values are redacted; raw credential and payload exposure flags are false.
  implemented_slice: Greedy and stochastic sampling reject NaN and positive infinity, treat negative infinity only as a suppression sentinel, and return GenerationFailed when no finite candidate remains.
  verification: Focused 2/2; runtime 199 unit plus 2 logit-probe plus 4 eval integration tests; optimized wasm32 build; WASM ABI smoke; rustfmt and diff checks pass.
  footprint_blocker: The current 602,862,400-byte fidelity profile exceeds the 256 MiB WASM transfer cap and the browser currently performs a whole-file main-thread read plus copy.
  search_contract_gap: Knowledge document search returns all 13 pages, while project-scoped durable memory search returns zero for the advertised concepts/report source.
  requested_reply: Return the 13 promoted memory event IDs or the intended memory query/indexing contract; do not invent identifiers.
  next_action: Design exact preflight plus a bounded OPFS/worker loader with mediated network policy, then prove cancellation, restart, multi-tab ownership, cross-browser fallback, and last-known-good rollback without changing the locked UI.
